+// (Asia/Kolkata, UTC+5:30) is deterministic and easy to reason about.
+//
+// AURA-CI-07 -- the anchor was the hard-coded 2026-12-01T06:30Z. Move
+// rejects a destination that is not in the future, so the Move scenarios
